# A bold question mark over a curious or thinking duck (1.2.0): sky-blue with a dark outline,
# lit from the top-left. Matches emotes/exclaim. Never mirrored (it is a glyph).
name: question
size: 6x10
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  H #d6f1ff
  B #7cc6f0
  D #3f8fcf

@frame question
.KKKK.
KHHBBK
KHKKBK
KKKBDK
..KBK.
..KKK.
......
..KKK.
..KBK.
..KKK.
